<g data-svugy-heading="">
<text fill="var(--svugy-text)" font-size="17" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start" textLength="174.242" x="18" y="-26.774">svugy · how it is built</text>
<text fill="var(--svugy-text-muted)" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" textLength="266.319" x="18" y="-8.774">text in → model → layout → geometry → SVG out</text>
</g>
<text fill="var(--svugy-text)" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start" textLength="103.973" x="1764.467" y="-31.133">Read it as a story</text>
<text fill="var(--svugy-text-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" textLength="159.897" x="1764.467" y="-11.133">① your text becomes a model</text>
<text fill="var(--svugy-text-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" textLength="227.595" x="1764.467" y="5.867">② the model becomes boxes in plan space</text>
<text fill="var(--svugy-text-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" textLength="186.538" x="1764.467" y="22.867">③ boxes become isometric shapes</text>
<text fill="var(--svugy-text-muted)" font-size="11" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" textLength="248.042" x="1764.467" y="39.867">④ shapes become one SVG file, runtime inside</text>
